# 换行符与二进制判定 —— 契约见 Felix2yu/.github 的 docs/code-style.md
# 仓库内一律 LF：开发机是 macOS、CI 与容器是 Linux，CRLF 只会在
# shell 脚本（bad interpreter）和 go:embed 的哈希计算上制造幽灵问题。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 脚本必须 LF，且要在所有平台上都按 LF 检出
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.dockerfile text eol=lf

# 二进制：不参与 diff / merge / 换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
*.mp3 binary
*.m4a binary
*.flac binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mkv binary
*.webm binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary

# GitHub 语言统计：依赖与产物不计入（否则 SvelteKit 仓统计被 dist 带偏）
**/node_modules/** linguist-vendored
**/dist/** linguist-generated=true
**/.svelte-kit/** linguist-generated=true
go.sum linguist-generated=true
